# Schema

One section per program; read the section of the program that owns your ticket. Every attachment of every program is below.

## HOS — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS

### Schema

One migration ledger across modules: take the next free number, RLS through `txn`, append `pkg/common/models`, add the SCHEMA.md row in the pack.

## HOS-UI — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS-UI

### Schema

One migration ledger across modules: take the next free number, RLS through `txn`, append `pkg/common/models`, add the SCHEMA.md row in the pack. HOSPACK/HOS-UI owns only 0017–0021 + 0026 (`app_*` / `app_*` tables) on top of the HOS ledger (which reserves the block); the platform ledger is read-only.

## HOS-Admin — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS-Admin

### Schema

One migration ledger across modules: take the next free number, RLS through `txn`, append `pkg/common/models`, add the SCHEMA.md row in the pack. HOSPACK/HOS-Admin owns only 0030–0039 (`admin_*` / `adm_*` tables) on top of the HOS ledger (which reserves the block); the platform ledger is read-only.

